  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divination Sphere (Viewing), Illusion Sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you create a viewing sensor, you may have it take any form that you could create with an illusion. While in this form, the viewing sensor can move at the same rate the illusion can move and is capable of creating any sensations you could create with your illusions (for example, if you have the Illusory Sound talent, the viewing sensor could speak).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/divination#toc119\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
